+   *  <li>upgrade one node
+   *  <li>run tests with systemProperty 'tests.rest.suite', 'mixed_cluster'
+   *  <li>upgrade one more node
+   *  <li>run tests with systemProperty 'tests.rest.suite', 'mixed_cluster' again
+   *  <li>updgrade the last node
